			"Your daily gift is ready. It has been ready since this morning. It is starting to take it personally. Please come and open it.",
			"Daily Rewards — Patience: running out" },
		{ "FAMILLE", "🐕", "The Dog", "WHO'S A GOOD HUMAN",
